Id":705300205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":2558044818,"text":"すると、それを協会の人がかなり気に入ってくれてね…サイリュスさんは写真をアルバムにまとめて、記念品として配ろうと提案してくれた。","nextNodeIds":[705300206]},{"nodeId":705300206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":354372922,"text":"ちょうど風花祭の時期だろ？モンドのあちこちで風花祭に関する写真を撮ってくるよう、サイリュスさんに言われたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[705300207]},{"nodeId":705300207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":260486202,"text":"風花祭の記念アルバムを作って、協会の冒険者たちに贈りたいらしい。","nextNodeIds":[705300208]},{"nodeId":705300208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":823464410,"text":"でも…モンドには写真スポットがたくさんあるし、私一人では到底…","nextNodeIds":[705300209]},{"nodeId":705300209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":279026850,"text":"それに協会の冒険者たちはみんなそれぞれの用事があって、手伝う暇がないそうなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[705300210]},{"nodeId":705300210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":4067766826,"text":"風花祭の期間中、人に頼みごとするのは良くないのは知ってる…でも旅人は「写真機」が得意だと聞いた。どうか助けてくれないか！","nextNodeIds":[705300211,705300213]},{"nodeId":705300211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2130728130,"text":"まあ、多少は心得がある…","nextNodeIds":[705300212]},{"nodeId":705300212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":3078863186,"text":"ふぅ…よかった。私の聞いた話は間違いじゃなかったんだね…","nextNodeIds":[705300216]},{"nodeId":705300216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":2541263666,"text":"コホンッ、話を戻そう…旅人、モンドの各地で「写真機」を使って撮影することを正式に依頼させてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[705300217]},{"nodeId":705300217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":1814902754,"text":"そうだ。私のこの「写真機」で撮ってきてほしい。いつもメンテナンスしてるから、使い勝手も悪くないはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[705300218]},{"nodeId":705300218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":1596214250,"text":"いい写真が撮りたければ、まずはいい「写真機」がないと、そうだろ？","nextNodeIds":[705300219]},{"nodeId":705300219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":3176306626,"text":"それじゃ頼んだよ。風花祭に関することなら、どんな写真でもいいから！","nextNodeIds":[705300220]},{"nodeId":705300220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":478529762,"text":"もちろん報酬も心配ない。協会のルールに則って出すようにする。ただ働きにはさせないさ。","nextNodeIds":[705300221]},{"nodeId":705300221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":3047884834,"text":"私はここで写真を整理して、分類してよう…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705300213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2440174098,"text":"どこでそれを聞いたの？","nextNodeIds":[705300214]},{"nodeId":705300214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":2410277842,"text":"協会の冒険者たちから聞いたんだ。その中にかなりの「写真機」好きがいてね。","nextNodeIds":[705300215]},{"nodeId":705300215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","textMapHash":2486630530,"text":"私たちは「写真機」愛好家協会を立ち上げようとしてるんだ。でも、サイリュスさんが許可してくれるかどうかはまだ…","nextNodeIds":[705300216]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7053002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30317"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7053002],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30317,"speakerName":"ファスビン","count":18},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"spe